Marius Nicolae 
October 9, 2025 at 2:30 PM

Hi Thomas,

Your file starts with an array ([ ... ]) where each element contains a personId and a nested array called employments.

When the data source is configured with Data array name = employments, Corporater doesn’t find it because the root is an array, not an object.
That’s why you get empty results.

Set the data array path to: $[*].employments
Update the field reference for personId to: parent.personId instead of root.personId.

That will flatten the data as expected — one row per employment — and include the personId from the higher level.
